{%- comment -%}
  Knock Twice — per-product "Hide on this product" switches.
  Product field custom.hidden_sections (list of single line text, preset
  choices): Size, Colors, Quantity, Photo upload, Tell Me More,
  Shipping & Stuff, Also Nice. Each ticked choice hides that part of the
  product page for this product only.

  Blocks that we own (colorways, dropdowns, quantity, upload) check the
  list themselves. This snippet hides the parts that are theme blocks or
  other sections (Size picker, Also Nice), and is rendered once from
  blocks/kt-product-meta.liquid.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign product_resource = closest.product | default: product
-%}
{%- capture hidden -%}{%- render 'kt-hidden-list', product_resource: product_resource -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- if hidden contains '|Size|' or hidden contains '|Also Nice|' -%}
  <style>
    {%- if hidden contains '|Size|' %}
      .product-details variant-picker,
      .product-details .variant-picker { display: none !important; }
    {%- endif -%}
    {%- if hidden contains '|Also Nice|' %}
      [id*="__product_recommendations"] { display: none !important; }
    {%- endif %}
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
